{"parentUuid":"f8400211-5a6c-421f-b529-2ecab093f0c0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgdJbFR5is5L1ZtLaDZhz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3406,"cache_read_input_tokens":90055,"output_tokens":2804,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1838},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3406,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2804,"cache_read_input_tokens":90055,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3406,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3406},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":26169,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgdJbF8yAnHpDVgKVtmon","requestRef":"e8f54a53-059e-4648-b71a-b2f12e9d6925","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"00cf7b92-8380-4cdd-bea7-0d69e556384c","timestamp":"2026-11-02T02:22:23.475Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\src\\JusPrin","sessionId":"06cfc08f-7504-4961-807f-e1d5fa2ffb14","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"jaunty-wobbling-gosling"}
{"parentUuid":"00cf7b92-8380-4cdd-bea7-0d69e556384c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgdJbFR5is5L1ZtLaDZhz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Close every JusPrin window first, because the script closes whichever copy is running. Then run this to start the whole test in a new data folder. It uses your real Anthropic key from this machine's JusPrin settings, and each reply is billed.\n\n```bash\npwsh -File C:/b/wk7/s42.ps1 -DataDir C:/b/wk7/ddMine -Shot C:/b/wk7/sonnet/mine-opened.png\n```\n\nIt starts the app once to create the data folder and closes it. Then it adds the Sonnet 5.5 settings, reopens the app with `Tape_4_3MF.3mf`, waits for the first reply and prints it. It also prints whether the Bambu profile is there, which should say `False`. The app stays open, running the `C:\\src\\JusPrin\\build` Release build, which includes the uncommitted fixes.\n\nYou can now test in the app window by hand:\n- **\"Yes, A1 mini\" path:** tap that button if the reply offers it. The buttons can change between runs.\n- **print-issues:** select the object and press an arrow key to nudge it. Then press the \"1 print issue\" chip and press **Ask AI**.\n- **Plain question:** type your question into the chat.\n\nTo run those steps from the command line instead, use one of these. The button text has to match exactly.\n\n```bash\nC:/Users/guitest/.local/node-v24.21.0-win-x64/node.exe C:/b/wk7/turn.mjs tap \"Yes, A1 mini\"\n```\n\n```bash\nC:/Users/guitest/.local/node-v24.21.0-win-x64/node.exe C:/b/wk7/turn.mjs say \"I'm new to this. The printer at the top says 'from the file' and the Slice button is grey. What does that mean, and what should I do?\"\n```\n\nTo see what was sent to the model, run the command below. Each request shows its real model, so go by that and not the picker, which said Opus 5.5 in my runs.\n\n```bash\nC:/Users/guitest/.local/node-v24.21.0-win-x64/node.exe C:/b/wk7/toolcalls.mjs C:/b/wk7/ddMine/jusprin/request-log\n```\n\nWhen you're finished, close the app and then run this to remove the key copies. The app saves its settings as it exits, so running this first would leave a copy behind. The last line should say `files still holding the key: 0`.\n\n```bash\nC:/Users/guitest/.local/node-v24.21.0-win-x64/node.exe C:/b/wk7/wipe-key.mjs C:/b/wk7/ddMine\n```\n\n- **Rerunning:** using the same `-DataDir` deletes that folder first, so pick a new name if you want to keep a run's request log.\n- **Not tried in this form:** I ran these scripts during my test, but not from these exact one-line commands.\n- **Setup screens:** this still writes the agent settings directly, so it doesn't test the setup screens."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3406,"cache_read_input_tokens":90055,"output_tokens":2804,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1838},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3406,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2804,"cache_read_input_tokens":90055,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3406,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3406},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgdJbF8yAnHpDVgKVtmon","requestRef":"e8f54a53-059e-4648-b71a-b2f12e9d6925","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"85e135fe-e1ef-437a-bb50-fdf5ba2efaa8","timestamp":"2026-11-02T02:22:25.016Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\src\\JusPrin","sessionId":"06cfc08f-7504-4961-807f-e1d5fa2ffb14","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"juspri