{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"06cfc08f-7504-4961-807f-e1d5fa2ffb14","bridgeSessionId":"cse_01Fx7Uiq9RmdSEcH8PJ8T1w1","lastSequenceNum":0,"ownerAccountUuid":"7911d73c-5552-4877-a943-6a0eba3d7c4d","ownerOrganizationUuid":"68a648b0-98a4-49c7-902b-ff471f8d1d46"}
{"parentUuid":"81c10a95-d4b3-468b-bce2-7df9f669f697","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cge2TXpj39iSfuvMLAQt2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"No, there are no commits yet, so there's nothing to squash. All the fixes are uncommitted changes in 16 files on `jusprin-newui`, which is level with origin.\n\nI recommend four separate commits rather than one, because these fixes are unrelated and can break in different ways. If the Mac retest finds a problem with one, you can revert just that fix.\n\n1. **Print issues cut off above 100% scale (Bug 1):** the canvas overlays now follow the display's scale. This covers `CanvasIcons`, `IssueOverlay`, `ViewportToolStrip`, `ToolValuePanel` and `CheckPrintDialog`, plus their test checks.\n2. **Printer from the file not marked (Bug 2):** the chip now reads where the printer came from off the stored preset. This covers `SetupCommands.cpp` and the comment in `PrinterOrigin.hpp`, plus the new harness check.\n3. **Skill text on Windows:** `skillParser.ts` now removes Windows line endings, so the model gets the same text from every build. This one is separate because it changes what the model receives from a Windows build; `skills.test.ts` goes with it.\n4. **Windows test fixes:** the two test compile breaks, the 2x snapshot drawing in `HeaderControls.cpp`, the `--printer-setup` stall and the nozzle check's unwritable-folder helper. These only change how tests build, run or take snapshots.\n\n`shell_harness.cpp` has changes for three of these, so I'd split that file across the commits.\n\nThe macOS retest of the Bug 2 fix, the canvas scale change and the `--printer-setup` fix hasn't been done. That doesn't stop us committing locally, and I wouldn't push until it's done.\n\n**Should I commit these as four separate commits, or put everything in one?** Either way, I won't push. I recommend four."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":993,"cache_read_input_tokens":143674,"output_tokens":616,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":993,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":616,"cache_read_input_tokens":143674,"cache_creation_input_tokens":993,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":993},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cge2TXVshpogJZMh97PS6","requestRef":"8185b170-baeb-43a2-9cb7-9f19048d2161","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"034492f4-5c95-4e7f-923d-d88f4b387ca4","timestamp":"2026-11-02T11:31:04.605Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\src\\JusPrin","sessionId":"06cfc08f-7504-4961-807f-e1d5fa2ffb14","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"jaunty-wobbling-gosling"}
